  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception interface, separating motion commands from sensor outcomes. The specification encodes safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk is preferred in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and recovery turns are used only when obstacles are detected. Recovery states are one-shot and only allow the appropriate turn. full_rotate is reserved for deliberate scan/search, not immediate recovery.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model motion and perception as a single plant automaton with all controllable and uncontrollable events.",
    "Specification automaton enforces safe, coverage-biased exploration: random_walk in clear, move_forward for short progress, recovery turns on obstacles, and quick return to exploration after recovery."
